=== table-repeated-binding.watsup ===
error[algo/repeated-table-binding]: table row pattern binds `y` more than once
  --> table-repeated-binding.watsup:11:12
   |
11 |   | (x, y, y, x) => true
   |            ^
   |
   | note: Each table parameter contributes one independent match pattern.
   |       Reusing a variable would add an equality condition between positions,
   |       which table rows do not support.
   |
   | related: first bound here
   |   --> table-repeated-binding.watsup:11:9
